  "text": "Next morning, a technician plays tones through both. At one thousand hertz the copy is perfect. At thirty-four hundred, the exchange passes seventy-one percent, and your copy passes ten. Customers sound dull, as if the top of every voice was shaved off. So what does the recipe do to frequencies?",
