  "i": 3,
  "text": "The exchange never sampled anything. Its sound is a voltage in a wire, changing smoothly, through a circuit of capacitors and coils. That's an analog filter. With no samples, there's no wheel and no limit: it has a response at every frequency, up to a million hertz and beyond.",
